          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Daze them with a headbutt, dig the body, then stamp them into the wall"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "멱살을 잡아 끌어당긴 뒤 큰 머리로 두 번 박아요. 잡기라 가드를 무시하고, 맞은 적은 어질어질 휘청여요": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Grab them by the collar, pull them in and headbutt twice. It's a grab, so guards don't matter — they're left reeling and dizzy"
